			"notes": "Open websites directly from the Minecraft chat!\n\n## Usage\n/website https://google.com\n/website youtube.com\n\nThe https:// prefix is added automatically if not specified.\n\n## Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader for Minecraft 1.21.1: https://fabricmc.net/use/\n2. Place Fabric API for 1.21.1 in your mods folder\n3. Place this JAR in your mods folder\n   - Windows: %appdata%\\.minecraft\\mods\\\n   - Linux: ~/.minecraft/mods/\n\n## Note\nThe website opens in your system browser (Chrome, Firefox, etc.)\n\n## Info\nThis mod only works if the Fabric API is installed in the modpack; it does not work with Feather or Laby mod."
